1
00:00:05,686 --> 00:00:08,136
(Leonard:)So are you really not
gonna do this movie?

2
00:00:08,289 --> 00:00:11,129
(Penny:)Well, I don't think it's the kind
of part that's good for my career.

3
00:00:11,425 --> 00:00:15,495
(Leonard:)But don't a lot of famous actors
get their start doing bad movies?

4
00:00:15,663 --> 00:00:18,043
(Penny:)Okay, I don't think Meryl Streep
ever had to say,

5
00:00:18,199 --> 00:00:21,369
"Must keep gorilla hands
from killing again!"

6
00:00:24,639 --> 00:00:27,549
(Raj:)If she did, it would be amazing.
That woman can do no wrong.

7
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:32,180
(Leonard:)I don't know anything
about show business,

8
00:00:32,346 --> 00:00:34,726
(Leonard:)so if you think it's reasonable
to turn down paid work

9
00:00:34,882 --> 00:00:36,352
and just bum through
your savings,

10
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:37,850
(Leonard:)I'm sure you know what
you're doing.

11
00:00:44,158 --> 00:00:45,658
(Amy:)I think we're gonna go.

12
00:00:46,794 --> 00:00:48,494
(Sheldon:)Are you sure?

13
00:00:48,496 --> 00:00:50,206
(Sheldon:)We were making fun of
failed careers.

14
00:00:50,364 --> 00:00:52,534
(Sheldon:)We didn't get to tap
the juicy vein that is Howard's.

15
00:00:54,335 --> 00:00:56,875
(Howard:)Hey, I work
at the same university you do.

16
00:00:57,038 --> 00:00:59,248
(Sheldon:)Yes, and Hawkeye's in
the Avengers,

17
00:00:59,407 --> 00:01:03,027
(Sheldon:)but no one ever says,
"Help, Hawkeye!"

